;~ (


;~ - Other: probably cyst(s). soft tissue density around sternum, suggest clinical correlation and contrast enhanced study if indicated.


;~ (Low sensitivity and specificity of non-contrast CT.)





;~ (RLL: right lower lobe.)


;~ )





